```
/* Barata: solo transform y opacity */
.tarjeta {
  transition: transform 0.2s ease, opacity 0.2s ease;
}
.tarjeta:hover {
  transform: translateY(-4px);
}

/* Cara: obliga a recalcular el layout */
.tarjeta--mala:hover {
  margin-top: -4px;
  height: 320px;
}
```

```
@media print {
  .barra-nav,
  .btn,
  .pie-redes,
  form[role="search"] {
    display: none;
  }

  body {
    background: #fff;
    color: #000;
    font-size: 12pt;
    line-height: 1.5;
  }

  * {
    box-shadow: none !important;
  }
}
```

```
@media print {
  a[href^="http"]::after {
    content: " (" attr(href) ")";
    font-size: 0.85em;
    word-break: break-all;
  }
}
```

```
@page {
  size: A4;
  margin: 2cm;
}

@media print {
  h2, h3 {
    break-after: avoid;
  }
  .tarjeta, tr, figure {
    break-inside: avoid;
  }
  .capitulo {
    break-before: page;
  }
}
```

```
